==Battleground==
*8 [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*8 [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*8 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Firecracker]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Zapy]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage may seem intimidating at first, but it can be easily cleared by using the [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] and [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]] [[Cat Combo]]s in addition to filling the rest of your slots with high dps, spammable units such as [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]]. It is also recommend to bring [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] for Freezing the Crustaceous Scissorex and [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] for slowing everybody down. Bringing a Rich Cat really helps with the startup process, as you can start stacking Courer Cats and other rushers almost immediately. The strat is to get to the base before the Crustaceous Scissorex comes out, and then burst it down as fast as humanly possible. Bring the [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt Cannon]] to prevent Scissorex from destroying your stack when he does spawn, which should buy you just enough time to destroy the enemy base.

